WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.601
The President of Micronesia,

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.103
group of small Pacific islands

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:04.304
standing up to China

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:06.373
in a scathing 13 page letter.

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:07.941
President David Panelo says

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:10.143
China is preparing to invade Taiwan

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:11.111
It goes on to say, quote,

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:11.978
One of the reasons

00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:13.346
that China's political warfare

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:15.348
is successful in so many arenas

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.951
is that we are bribed to be complicit

00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:20.320
and bribed to be silent.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.921
Selina Wang is OUTFRONT in Beijing.

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:22.722
And Selina.

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:25.191
These are incredibly strong words

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:26.926
from a leader of a small nation.

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:28.728
Right, standing up

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:30.730
to the Chinese juggernaut.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.033
How is China responding

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.536
Yeah, Aaron, this was an explosive

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:37.537
letter and China

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:38.972
responded by dismissing

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:41.041
it as smears and accusations.

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:42.242
The foreign ministry said

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:43.376
they've always respected

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:44.110
how Micronesia

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:46.379
chooses its own development.

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:47.881
Now, Micronesia is president

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:48.948
David Panelo.

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:49.983
He also revealed that he had

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:51.251
considered switching

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:54.320
diplomatic recognition to Taipei Now,

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:55.055
penniless term

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.523
in office is set to expire in

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:57.690
just a couple of months.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.793
He's been the president since 2019.

00:00:59.793 --> 00:01:01.261
And this is not the first time

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:02.195
he's spoken out before.

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:02.762
On China's

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:04.431
growing influence in the region.

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:06.266
And the context of this letter

00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:08.835
is increasing fears from regional powers

00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:10.470
about exactly that.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.671
Military strategists

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:13.506
see the Pacific Islands location

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:15.875
as this key connector between the U.S.

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:18.211
territory of Juan and Australia.

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:19.312
And both the U.S.

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:20.246
and Australia

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:21.948
are concerned about China's

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:23.550
more assertive

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:24.717
increasingly assertive

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:26.352
and aggressive posture in the South

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:27.187
China Sea

00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:28.855
as it's been extending its reach

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:30.690
further west into Pacific waters,

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:33.026
including towards Micronesia.

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:33.660
And meanwhile,

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.095
the island nations themselves,

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:36.763
they don't want to be a pawn

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:38.598
in this greater power struggle.

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:39.866
China has become a key

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:42.001
trading partner for their economies.

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:43.536
And as Backstrom major projects

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:44.904
in some of those countries,

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:45.839
including highways

00:01:45.839 --> 00:01:48.007
in Papua New Guinea and bridges and Fiji.

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.442
It is pretty interesting, though,

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:50.043
like to see that.

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:51.211
Okay, so he's leaving power,

00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:52.712
but what does this signal

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:54.047
and the fact that he would call it out

00:01:54.047 --> 00:01:55.181
and put it out there

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.249
for all these other countries

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:56.716
around the world

00:01:56.716 --> 00:01:57.784
who are dealing with the same thing,

00:01:57.784 --> 00:02:00.053
maybe that's where the power might be.

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:01.087
There's also growing concern.

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:01.921
I understand, Syleena,

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:04.457
of another lockdown in China

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:06.659
where you currently are today,

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:07.694
but not because of COVID

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:12.532
Well, this time, Erin, it's for the flu.

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:13.867
So the Chinese city of Shehan

00:02:13.867 --> 00:02:16.035
has published an emergency response plan

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:17.470
that says if community

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:18.271
spread reaches

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:18.705
an acute

00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:21.074
level officials can use lockdowns, school

00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:22.642
and business closures.

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:23.443
Now, no surprise,

00:02:23.443 --> 00:02:25.612
but this has led to significant backlash

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:26.913
on Chinese social media.

00:02:26.913 --> 00:02:28.248
I mean, it's only been a few months

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:29.382
since China dropped

00:02:29.382 --> 00:02:30.884
zero COVID and Shiyan,

00:02:30.884 --> 00:02:32.152
which is a city of around

00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:33.653
13 million people.

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:35.555
It went through a brutal lockdown

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:37.123
back in 20, 21.

00:02:37.123 --> 00:02:38.424
But it is important to mention

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:40.393
that this emergency plan, it's

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:42.162
not unusual for local governments

00:02:42.162 --> 00:02:43.029
